{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 0,
    "dDurationMs": 6144,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There is one bill that lands in your\nmailbox every single year, the biggest"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6144,
    "dDurationMs": 2701,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "single bill most homeowners will ever\nface,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 9546,
    "dDurationMs": 5283,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and once you turn sixty five the law in\nalmost every state says you may be"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 14829,
    "dDurationMs": 5503,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "allowed to freeze it, lower it, and in\nsome cases stop a large part of it for"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 20332,
    "dDurationMs": 340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 22333,
    "dDurationMs": 2622,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I am talking about your property tax."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 25555,
    "dDurationMs": 2281,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not a small discount shaved off the top."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 27836,
    "dDurationMs": 5564,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not a coupon in the mail. I mean freezing\nthe whole thing in place so it can"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 33400,
    "dDurationMs": 4702,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "never climb on you again, and knocking\nthousands of dollars off what you owe,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 38102,
    "dDurationMs": 2962,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for one reason and one reason only."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 41564,
    "dDurationMs": 4463,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because you finally asked. And here is the\npart that should make you angry."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 46728,
    "dDurationMs": 3982,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Nobody whose job it is to collect that\nmoney has the slightest reason to tell"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 50710,
    "dDurationMs": 2822,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you. Your county will not call you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 53892,
    "dDurationMs": 1541,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Your city will not send a letter."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 55433,
    "dDurationMs": 5043,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The tax office will not knock on your door\nand say, you have been overpaying"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 60476,
    "dDurationMs": 2141,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "us for years, let us fix that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 63097,
    "dDurationMs": 4243,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It sits there quietly, in the hope that\nyou keep paying out of a lifetime of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 67340,
    "dDurationMs": 5643,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "habit. Thank you for stopping here,\nbecause most people scroll right past a"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 72983,
    "dDurationMs": 3962,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "video like this, and it quietly costs them\nthousands of dollars."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 77646,
    "dDurationMs": 5623,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So today I am going to walk you through\nexactly how seniors freeze and lower"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 83269,
    "dDurationMs": 5123,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this bill, the different breaks you may\nqualify for, and the one quiet mistake"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 88392,
    "dDurationMs": 4123,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that keeps this money draining out of your\naccount year after year."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 93295,
    "dDurationMs": 4883,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Stay with me all the way to the end,\nbecause the last part is the one almost"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 98178,
    "dDurationMs": 5063,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "nobody knows, and it is the one that can\nhand you back money you already overpaid."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 103721,
    "dDurationMs": 3402,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let me start with why this bill is the one\nworth fighting."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 107603,
    "dDurationMs": 4203,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Property tax is different from almost\nevery other bill you have, because it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 111806,
    "dDurationMs": 4783,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "never stops climbing. As the years go by\nand homes in your area are worth more,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 116889,
    "dDurationMs": 4222,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the county raises the value it puts on\nyour home, and your tax bill climbs"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 121111,
    "dDurationMs": 4503,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "right along with it. So a person who has\nlived in the same paid off house for"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 125614,
    "dDurationMs": 4583,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "thirty years can end up with a property\ntax bill three or four times higher"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 130197,
    "dDurationMs": 5023,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "than the day they moved in, on the very\nsame house, on a fixed retirement income"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 135220,
    "dDurationMs": 2181,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that did not triple to match it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 137761,
    "dDurationMs": 4803,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is the trap. Your income stopped\ngrowing, but this one bill did not."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 142564,
    "dDurationMs": 4022,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that is exactly the problem these\nsenior breaks were written to fix."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 147427,
    "dDurationMs": 4803,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So here is the first break, and it is the\nfoundation of all of it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 152610,
    "dDurationMs": 2121,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is called the homestead exemption."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 155312,
    "dDurationMs": 4702,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In plain words, it tells the county to\nknock a chunk of value off your home"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 160014,
    "dDurationMs": 4873,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "before they tax it. If your home is valued\nat three hundred thousand dollars"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 164887,
    "dDurationMs": 5013,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and your exemption is fifty thousand, then\nyou are only taxed as if the home"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 169900,
    "dDurationMs": 2161,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "were worth two hundred and fifty thousand."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 172061,
    "dDurationMs": 5203,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You are taxed on less, so you owe less,\nevery year, for as long as you live"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 177264,
    "dDurationMs": 5264,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there. Almost every state offers some\nversion of this for a primary home, and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 182528,
    "dDurationMs": 1841,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "here is the important part for you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 184869,
    "dDurationMs": 4823,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you turn sixty five, most states give\nyou an extra, larger exemption on"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 189692,
    "dDurationMs": 2441,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "top of the regular one, just for your age."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 192654,
    "dDurationMs": 2741,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "More value knocked off. A smaller bill."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 195715,
    "dDurationMs": 5504,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But only if it is on file. The second\nbreak is the one that changes everything,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 201219,
    "dDurationMs": 2781,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it is the reason I made this video."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 204641,
    "dDurationMs": 2141,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is called the senior freeze."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 207542,
    "dDurationMs": 5003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Some places call it an assessment freeze,\nsome call it a tax ceiling, but the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 212545,
    "dDurationMs": 2862,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "idea is the same, and it is powerful."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 216167,
    "dDurationMs": 5764,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Once you qualify, usually in the year you\nturn sixty five, it locks your home's"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 221931,
    "dDurationMs": 5263,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "taxable value, or in some states the tax\nbill itself, right where it is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 227474,
    "dDurationMs": 4863,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Frozen. So even as every other house on\nyour street keeps getting valued higher"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 232337,
    "dDurationMs": 4403,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and higher, yours is held still at the\nlevel of the year you signed up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 237440,
    "dDurationMs": 4343,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Your neighbors who never applied watch\ntheir bills climb every single year."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 242323,
    "dDurationMs": 5843,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yours sits frozen in place. Over ten or\nfifteen years of retirement, that one"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 248166,
    "dDurationMs": 4703,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "form can save you tens of thousands of\ndollars, and it does nothing but protect"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 252869,
    "dDurationMs": 5463,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you the longer you live. Now let me be\nhonest and accurate with you, because"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 258332,
    "dDurationMs": 3282,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this is your money and I will not\noverpromise."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 262155,
    "dDurationMs": 2681,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These breaks are not identical in every\nstate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 265456,
    "dDurationMs": 4583,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In a few states the freeze locks the\nactual dollar amount of your bill so it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 270039,
    "dDurationMs": 5303,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "can never rise. In others it freezes the\nvalue of your home, which means your"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 275342,
    "dDurationMs": 4923,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "bill can still move a little if the local\ntax rate changes, but far, far less"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 280265,
    "dDurationMs": 5864,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "than it would have. Some states have no\nincome limit at all, so every homeowner"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 286129,
    "dDurationMs": 5603,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "over sixty five qualifies. Others only\ngive the freeze to seniors under a certain"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 291732,
    "dDurationMs": 4443,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "income, which in some places is around\nseventy five thousand dollars a year,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 296495,
    "dDurationMs": 4522,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is higher than most retirees think,\nso do not assume you earn too much"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 301017,
    "dDurationMs": 641,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to qualify."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 302518,
    "dDurationMs": 3783,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The rules carry different names and\ndifferent lines in every state."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 306541,
    "dDurationMs": 5843,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But some version of an age based break\nexists almost everywhere, and the odds"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 312384,
    "dDurationMs": 4363,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are very good that one is sitting there\nright now with your name on it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 317007,
    "dDurationMs": 5923,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There is a third kind of help worth\nknowing about, on top of freezing and lowering."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 324031,
    "dDurationMs": 4222,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Many states also offer what is called a\nrebate, or a circuit breaker."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 329074,
    "dDurationMs": 5203,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is different. Instead of lowering the\nbill before you pay, it sends money"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 334277,
    "dDurationMs": 5323,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "back to you after you pay, if your\nproperty tax is large compared to your income,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 340221,
    "dDurationMs": 4082,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is exactly the situation so many\nretirees are in."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 344883,
    "dDurationMs": 4803,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It can be a few hundred dollars, or it can\nbe more, coming back to you as a"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 349686,
    "dDurationMs": 1161,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "check or a credit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 351847,
    "dDurationMs": 3202,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Most seniors have never heard the term and\nnever claim it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 355590,
    "dDurationMs": 2781,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is one more pile of money left sitting\non the table."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 358811,
    "dDurationMs": 6184,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, here is the one quiet mistake, the\nwhole reason this video exists, and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 364995,
    "dDurationMs": 4002,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I need you to hear it clearly, because it\nis the difference between saving"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 368997,
    "dDurationMs": 1942,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "thousands and saving nothing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 371799,
    "dDurationMs": 1701,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "None of this happens on its own."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 373740,
    "dDurationMs": 4663,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not one piece of it. The county does not\nlook at your birthday and quietly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 378403,
    "dDurationMs": 4172,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "lower your bill. There is no automatic\nswitch that flips when you turn sixty"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 382575,
    "dDurationMs": 631,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "five."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 384106,
    "dDurationMs": 4723,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Every single one of these breaks, the\nhomestead exemption, the senior freeze,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 389189,
    "dDurationMs": 4843,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the rebate, all of them, requires you to\nfill out a form and file it with your"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 394032,
    "dDurationMs": 5483,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "county. That is it. That is the mistake\nthat costs people the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 400876,
    "dDurationMs": 1771,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "most. They assume that because they are\nold enough, it must be handled."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 402647,
    "dDurationMs": 4553,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is not. Millions of seniors who qualify\nfor every one of these breaks are"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 407200,
    "dDurationMs": 5263,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "still paying the full, unfrozen, climbing\nbill, year after year, for no reason"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 412463,
    "dDurationMs": 3242,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "other than that a single piece of paper\nwas never turned in."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 415965,
    "dDurationMs": 4503,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So let me tell you exactly what to do, and\nit is simpler than you fear."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 420468,
    "dDurationMs": 2421,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You are looking for one office."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 423370,
    "dDurationMs": 5323,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is usually called the county assessor,\nor in some states the county appraisal"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 428693,
    "dDurationMs": 5103,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "district. That is the office that decides\nyour home's value and applies these"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 433796,
    "dDurationMs": 5003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "breaks. You can call them directly, and\nhere are the exact words to use."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 439299,
    "dDurationMs": 1241,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Say, I am over"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 441420,
    "dDurationMs": 1061,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "sixty five,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 443702,
    "dDurationMs": 2801,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I own and live in my home, and I want to\napply for the over sixty five homestead"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 446503,
    "dDurationMs": 1821,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "exemption and the senior freeze."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 448324,
    "dDurationMs": 3322,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That one sentence puts you on the right\npath."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 452227,
    "dDurationMs": 1641,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They will tell you what to file."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 454348,
    "dDurationMs": 4562,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you would rather look first, search\nyour own county's name plus the words"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 458910,
    "dDurationMs": 5124,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "senior property tax exemption, and the\nofficial county page will come up with"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 464034,
    "dDurationMs": 2121,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the form and the rules for where you live."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 467015,
    "dDurationMs": 5163,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you make that call, ask them these\nfour things, so nothing is left on"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 472178,
    "dDurationMs": 5403,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the table. One. Which exemptions am I\neligible for now that I am sixty five."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 477581,
    "dDurationMs": 5023,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Two. Is there a freeze or a ceiling, and\nhow do I lock it in this year."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 483165,
    "dDurationMs": 3942,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Three. Is there a rebate or refund program\nbased on my income."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 487667,
    "dDurationMs": 3563,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And four, and this is the one almost\nnobody thinks to ask."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 491610,
    "dDurationMs": 4562,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If I qualified in past years but never\napplied, can I get any of it back."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 496753,
    "dDurationMs": 1921,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because in a number of states, you can."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 499114,
    "dDurationMs": 4083,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They will let you recover a year,\nsometimes more, of the money you overpaid"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 503197,
    "dDurationMs": 2621,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "while you were eligible and simply did not\nknow."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 505818,
    "dDurationMs": 2642,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is money you have already earned\nback."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 508860,
    "dDurationMs": 2181,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All you have to do is ask for it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 511221,
    "dDurationMs": 4483,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let me also warn you about one thing, so\nit does not trip you up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 516164,
    "dDurationMs": 3322,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In some places these breaks are not one\nand done."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 520247,
    "dDurationMs": 4162,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A few states ask you to confirm once a\nyear that you still live in the home,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 524689,
    "dDurationMs": 2662,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or the freeze can quietly fall off."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 528011,
    "dDurationMs": 2322,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So when you call, ask that too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 530753,
    "dDurationMs": 3742,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do I ever need to renew this, or is it\npermanent once I am approved."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 534495,
    "dDurationMs": 4923,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Get the answer, write it down, and if it\nrenews, mark it on a calendar."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 540198,
    "dDurationMs": 4603,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do not let a form you already won slip\naway over a piece of mail you missed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 545181,
    "dDurationMs": 5163,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now step back and look at what all of this\nshares, because it is the same lesson"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 550344,
    "dDurationMs": 2162,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "under every senior break there is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 553126,
    "dDurationMs": 5323,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The money is real, the programs already\nexist, and they were written for exactly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 558449,
    "dDurationMs": 1041,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "your situation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 560190,
    "dDurationMs": 4643,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The only thing standing between you and a\nfrozen, lowered bill is a form the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 564833,
    "dDurationMs": 1981,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "county is in no hurry to hand you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 567454,
    "dDurationMs": 1922,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They are counting on you not asking."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 570116,
    "dDurationMs": 4623,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is your home, the thing you worked\nyour whole life to pay for, and protecting"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 574739,
    "dDurationMs": 4122,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it from a bill that never stops climbing\nis one of the most powerful moves"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 578861,
    "dDurationMs": 1321,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can make in retirement,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 580882,
    "dDurationMs": 2762,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it costs you nothing but one phone\ncall."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 585085,
    "dDurationMs": 3702,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So here is the only thing I am asking you\nto do this week."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 589467,
    "dDurationMs": 5183,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do not file this away as a someday task,\nbecause someday is how another full"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 594650,
    "dDurationMs": 5284,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "year of overpaying slips by. Find your\ncounty assessor or appraisal district,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 599934,
    "dDurationMs": 3602,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by phone or online, and ask the one\nquestion."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 604156,
    "dDurationMs": 3182,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I am over sixty five and I own my home."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 608078,
    "dDurationMs": 4503,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What property tax breaks can I file for,\nand can I lock in the freeze this"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 612581,
    "dDurationMs": 3682,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "year. Then fill out whatever they put in\nfront of you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 616423,
    "dDurationMs": 5684,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One afternoon. One form. And a bill that\nhas been climbing for years finally"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 622107,
    "dDurationMs": 560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "stops."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 623628,
    "dDurationMs": 4442,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is general information to help you\nknow what to ask for, not legal or"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 628070,
    "dDurationMs": 4243,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "tax advice, and the exact rules and income\nlimits are different in every state,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 632833,
    "dDurationMs": 2221,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so confirm the details with your own\ncounty."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 635675,
    "dDurationMs": 4232,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the question itself is free to ask,\nand for most homeowners over sixty"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 639907,
    "dDurationMs": 711,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "five,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 641378,
    "dDurationMs": 3342,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "asking it is worth more than any other\nthing you will do with your money this"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 644720,
    "dDurationMs": 5363,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "year. And before you go, think of one\nperson who needs to hear this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 650643,
    "dDurationMs": 5344,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Someone who has lived in the same home for\ndecades, on a fixed income, watching"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 655987,
    "dDurationMs": 5103,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that property tax bill climb and quietly\npaying it because they never knew"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 661090,
    "dDurationMs": 800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they could stop."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 662731,
    "dDurationMs": 3682,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A parent, a neighbor, an old friend living\nalone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 666993,
    "dDurationMs": 5103,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Send them this video. It could be worth\nthousands of dollars to them, and all"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 672096,
    "dDurationMs": 3222,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it took was someone finally telling them\nto ask."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 676058,
    "dDurationMs": 4283,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Go and make your call this week, and help\none other person make theirs."
    } ]
  } ]
}
